      "content": "I hear the extreme pain and despair in your words, and I want you to know that feeling trapped and hopeless is a very dangerous and heavy burden to carry. Your thoughts about \"not being there\" are likely stress responses to overwhelming distress, not a final solution that will bring the peace you seek. Please consider reaching out to a suicide prevention line like 988 (in the US) or a trusted friend or family member immediately for support, as they can help you navigate these overwhelming feelings.",
